    confidenceNotes: 'High named-reach and gauge confidence with guarded endpoint confidence: American Whitewater publishes the distinct 6.4-mile reach, difficulty range, route-specific feature sequence, and Rosendale gauge; Riverfacts maps the High Falls and Rosendale endpoint anchors. The coordinates are access-area anchors rather than surveyed ramps, and current public landing, hydropower diversion, private-bank, and rescue conditions must be verified in the field.',
