    statusText: 'Planning-only advanced moving water. Launch from the marked Round Lake Preserve boat launch only during posted hours, inspect the wetland channel and every log/beaver obstruction, and use the direct USGS 01335698 Coons reading as context rather than permission to run. Spring water can rise quickly; wear cold-water gear and carry for any blocked channel. Finish at the public Mechanicville City Dock before the Hudson/Mechanicville dam and do not assume private banks or bridge shoulders are access.',
