    shuttle: 'Stage a downstream vehicle at Mechanicville City Dock where current public parking and dock rules allow, then drive to the Round Lake Preserve parking area. Allow extra time for the 0.05-mile boardwalk, scouting, carries, spring traffic, and a conservative extraction plan; do not stage at Coons Crossing unless current public access is separately confirmed.',
