      'The route includes the distinct Coons Crossing-to-Hudson Tenandeho section, but Coons Crossing itself is not treated as a public independent launch in this card. Do not convert a bridge shoulder or race start into ordinary access.',
      'The Mechanicville City Dock is a public cartop/day-use waterfront site. Confirm the current dock, construction, boat traffic, and legal take-out path; do not land on private shoreline or continue toward dam/canal infrastructure.',
      'Round Lake, marsh channels, and the lower kill can have water-quality, vegetation, log-jam, and beaver-obstruction issues. A favorable Coons gauge number does not clear the full route.',
