      'Norsen Bridge Park is currently listed by Wayne County as having a kayak launch, but park hours, landing condition, parking, and maintenance can change. Use the named launch and no private or roadside substitute.',
      'The regional blueway report is older than the current park listings. Treat its route, hazard, and access descriptions as planning evidence that needs current field verification, especially around canal spillways, dams, and downed trees.',
