    confidenceNotes: 'Moderate-to-high route confidence for the bounded public waterway: Monroe County currently documents the Ellison launch, NYSDEC lists LaSalle’s Landing as a public hand launch, and the Town of Penfield publishes a canoe/kayak waterway map connecting the two. Flow confidence is intentionally low because USGS 04232030 is a discontinued/historical station record without current continuous data.',
