    camping: 'No on-route water-access camping is claimed. Use a separate Catskills basecamp such as NYSDEC Devil’s Tombstone Campground, subject to current season, reservation, fee, and firewood rules; primitive camping on state land requires following current DEC regulations and staying at least 150 feet from water, roads, and trails where applicable.',
    campingClassification: 'nearby_basecamp',
