      'Route 23A is the take-out boundary described by American Whitewater. Do not extend downstream into the Schoharie Creek without a separate access, hazard, and route review.',
      'Nearby campground and primitive-camping rules are separate from route access. Do not camp at the bridges, on private banks, or on a rapid beach merely because it is adjacent to the creek.',
