    shuttle: 'Stage the downstream vehicle at confirmed Spencerport Village Docks, then drive to Brockport Welcome Center/Harvester Park. Allow extra time for bridge delays, marina/event congestion, limited bailouts, and a conservative take-out before the Union Street lift bridge.',
