    confidenceNotes: 'High corridor confidence: the official Canalway stewardship inventory publishes this distinct 11.5-mile Bushnell’s Basin-to-Macedon section and its Ayrault/Fairport/Macedon launch chain. The Rochester guidebook supplies the public water-entry coordinates, Fairport bridge and harbor warnings, Perinton Park facilities, Macedon campground and marina context, and Lock E30 endpoint facilities; NYSDEC confirms the current Bushnell’s Basin launch. USGS 04218700 is a same-canal proxy and no numeric threshold is asserted.',
