    camping: 'Montezuma Anchorage Paddle Camp near the Richmond Aqueduct publishes private marina camping with floating docks and a ramp; reserve and confirm current conditions directly. No dispersed camping is claimed at Mays Point, Richmond Aqueduct, Howland Island WMA, the Montezuma refuge, canal banks, or Town of Mentz; the Mentz ramp has a 24-hour overnight-parking limit rather than a camping authorization.',
