    camping: 'Little Falls Canal Harbor and Rotary Park documents camping, water, showers, laundry, and boat-launch facilities; confirm current municipal availability and fees. No camping is claimed at the dams, Herkimer Home, Rocky Rift, or Lock E16, so use the harbor campground or separately confirmed nearby lodging rather than assuming shoreline camping.',
