      'At Feeder Dam, carry around the gate to the dock and stay away from the dam, headgates, hydro structures, and restricted shoreline. At Finch Pruyn, get low for the pipe crossing if the water is high; never force a passage or land on industrial property.',
      'Use only Feeder Dam/Overlook Park, Shermantown Road, and Martindale Boat Basin access. Do not attempt to remove a boat from the canal at an unlisted point if that requires private property, and take out at Martindale before the Five Combines locks.',
      'Motorized boats are not permitted on the feeder canal. Respect posted leash, fishing, swimming, parking, and seasonal rules and report changing obstructions to the current access steward before relying on the route.',
