    statusText: 'Advanced planning-only high-water route. Confirm both DEC hand launches, local level and recent rain, visible wood, road/gate status, and an experienced group before launching. Scout or portage every named fall and rapid; treat Copper Rock Falls and any unmarked drop as a hard hazard boundary. Finish at First Brook and do not continue downstream without a separate access and whitewater review.',
