    confidenceNotes: 'Good corridor confidence with guarded endpoint and flow confidence: American Whitewater publishes the distinct 2.7-mile Downerville-to-Russell reach, endpoint descriptions, Class I–II character, and one-rapid progression. NYSDEC publishes Downerville Forest public parking/frontage/camping and warns that the North Branch ford can have dangerous high water; regional access guidance identifies the Russell bridge. Coordinates remain access-area anchors requiring current landing, parking, traffic, and private-bank verification.',
