    confidenceNotes: 'High confidence in the distinct American Whitewater reach, approximate mileage/class, feature sequence, endpoint anchors, and seasonal character. DEC independently confirms East Branch spring/high-water paddling and roadside access, but roadside endpoints are not maintained ramps and the available Hope gauge is only a broad downstream proxy; the card remains planning-only.',
