    camping: 'NYSDEC documents designated tent sites along the East Branch and nearby managed campgrounds including Indian Lake Islands, Lewey Lake, Moffitt Beach, and Sacandaga. Use only marked legal sites or reserved campground sites; do not camp at roadside pull-outs, the gorge, private banks, or the take-out.',
