    statusText: 'Planning-only tidal route. The Great River ramp requires the current Town of Islip launch permit and parking compliance; Heckscher access is subject to park entrance, seasonal, and posted launch rules. Check NOAA tide predictions, wind and thunderstorms, local depth/current, USGS 01306495 stage and water-quality context, park/ramp status, and a conservative return or shuttle plan before launching. Do not enter the protected upper Connetquot preserve or continue into open Great South Bay without a separate access and marine-safety review.',
