      'Use USGS 01306495 only as same-river stage and water-quality context. Withdraw for poor visibility, thunderstorms, unsafe wind, suspicious sheen/scum, contaminated-water advisories, insufficient depth, or a take-out that would require an unauthorized bank landing.',
      'Stay in public water and use only the named ramp/park access. Do not land on private shoreline, marsh islands, docks, marinas, refuge property, or restricted preserve shore, and do not assume the upper Johnson Avenue–Sunrise Highway preserve is open for general paddling.',
