    gaugeStatusNote: 'USGS 01361450 is a direct Hudson River station at Catskill near the downstream endpoint. It reports local stage context, but a tidal estuary trip still requires tide/current, wind, wave, traffic, water-quality, and shoreline inspection; the gauge is not a route-wide safety threshold.',
