    statusText: 'Use USGS 04256000 at Donnattsburg together with the American Whitewater route status and a local visual inspection. The upper reach starts with moving Class I–II water and builds to continuous Class II–III features with a few more challenging drops; 49 cfs was recently reported below the recommended flow on the route page. Do not launch if the gauge status, trend, wood, temperature, or group skill is inconsistent with a controlled Class II–III(IV) run, and take out at Donnattsburg before the lower-section boundary.',
