    statusText: 'Planning-only multi-day reservoir and portage route. Confirm operator/DEC access, the Moshier powerhouse carry, High Falls Pond take-out, current reservoir levels, wind, portage conditions, and campsite availability before departure. Portage every dam, intake, powerhouse, and marked obstruction; do not paddle into a bypassed reach or hydropower structure.',
