    shuttle: 'Stage the downstream vehicle at the confirmed High Falls Pond Old State Road access, then drive the shuttle boat and gear to the Moshier powerhouse/trailhead. Build in time for sign-in, the initial quarter-mile parking carry, six portages, reservoir wind, and a daylight reserve.',
    camping: 'The route guide documents primitive island campsites on Soft Maple and High Falls reservoirs plus a formal campground with restrooms and showers on Soft Maple. Reserve or verify the formal site, use only marked/designated campsites, and do not treat any shoreline as legal camping.',
