      'The stored High Falls coordinate follows the Old State Road north-shore carry area rather than a surveyed dock. Confirm exact water entry, parking, road condition, and the dam boundary before relying on it as a take-out.',
      'The route includes regulated reservoirs and hydropower facilities. Public launch or portage access does not authorize entry into powerhouse grounds, intakes, bypassed reaches, or private shoreline.',
      'Distance excludes repeated portage carries and may vary with reservoir operations, channel routing, and campsite or take-out choice.',
