    confidenceNotes: 'Moderate-to-high corridor confidence: the watershed council names the lower-half paddling corridor and Munro Park put-in, DEC confirms Ninemile Creek public access and a canoe/kayak launch, and DEC emergency-response material plus recurring public paddling events corroborate the Pumphouse launch area. Both stored coordinates are conservative water-entry anchors and require current field verification. The same-creek USGS station is historical and not usable for live scoring.',
