    statusText: 'Permit-only advanced whitewater. Obtain current Letchworth State Park kayaking permission before entering the gorge, use only Trail 5/Lee’s Landing and Trail 13/St. Helena access, and confirm the park’s current road, gate, parking, and shuttle instructions. Treat about 9 ft as a low-water technical reference, 10.5 ft as a stronger Class III planning context, and 14 ft or higher as closed; scout the gorge, stay clear of the railroad bridge and waterfalls, and take out at St. Helena.',
