    shuttle: 'Stage the downstream vehicle at the NYSDEC Rosendale launch on Springtown Road, then drive to the NYSDEC New Paltz launch. Confirm both lots, the floating dock/carry, parking, and the exact water entry before unloading; allow daylight for shallow sections and a conservative early take-out.',
    camping: 'No legal on-route or endpoint camping is claimed. The New Paltz and Rosendale launches are day-use access areas; arrange separate lodging or a legal managed campground and do not camp on Wallkill banks, islands, utility land, or the Sturgeon Pool shoreline without explicit authorization.',
