    statusText: 'Planning-only Class I–II moving water with advanced scouting expectations. Launch at the current Burtonsville public hand launch, inspect the channel and wood, and finish at the current Dufel Road / Schoharie Crossing public launch before the Schoharie–Mohawk confluence. Do not treat bridge shoulders, private banks, the confluence, or the Mohawk River as an unreviewed continuation or emergency take-out. Confirm the full daylight shuttle, current gauge trend, rainfall, debris, landing, parking, and posted state-site hours before committing.',
