    summary: "A planning-only six-mile East Branch Delaware River float from Downsville to the NYS Parks Shinhopple-area hand launch. Al's current 2026 outfitter page publishes the named Downsville-to-Shinhopple itinerary, typical three-to-four-hour duration, one-way vehicle transport, mostly quiet-water character, and seasonal/weather depth variation. The current state launch directory corroborates the downstream hand launch with ten-car parking; the Downsville start is retained as managed outfitter access and must not be presented as an unrestricted state launch.",
