    confidenceNotes: 'High confidence in the lower-reach concept and public launch/take-out network from current regional, town, community-profile, and NYSDEC sources. Moderate exact mileage and landing-line confidence because the final reach expands into marsh and Lake Champlain; the card uses conservative planning distance and named public facilities rather than an asserted surveyed channel.',
