      'Use USGS 04264331 only as broad coordinated-discharge context. Check current NYPA/Seaway navigation notices, local launch conditions, recent weather, vessel traffic, and a visual assessment; no numeric discharge threshold certifies this route.',
      'Stay out of navigation channels and well clear of commercial ships, barges, recreational boats, dams, intakes, power facilities, shoreline works, and any restricted or international-border area. Cross wakes at a safe angle and keep the group together.',
      'Take out at the Massena NYPA launch. Do not improvise a landing on private shoreline, islands, industrial property, wildlife-area shoreline outside the launch, or a navigation structure; turn around early if wind or waves exceed the group’s margin.',
