    statusText: 'Planning-only multi-day wilderness traverse. Launch at the named Lower Dam hand launch, carry around Lows Upper Dam, remain on the permitted/public route across Lows Lake, use only the signed Oswegatchie Canoe Carry, portage High Falls and any beaver obstructions, and finish at the current Inlet Road hand launch. The proxy gauge is informational; wind, local water, carry conditions, private shoreline, campsite rules, daylight, and emergency distance control the trip. Do not use private roads, camp leases, unmarked shoreline, or the Lows Upper Dam private road as shortcuts.',
